# CASTLE Conference Website

Modern academic conference website for **CASTLE 6.0** — Conference on Social, Science, Technology, Language, and Education Research.

Designed with a clean editorial aesthetic, responsive user experience, and publication-oriented conference identity.

---

# Overview

CASTLE is an international academic conference platform organized to support interdisciplinary collaboration, scholarly discussion, and research publication across various academic fields.

This website was redesigned from the original EXPO structure into a modern symposium-style conference platform focused on:

* clean UI/UX
* responsive design
* academic branding
* publication pathways
* professional conference presentation
* premium minimalist aesthetic

---

# Main Features

## Hero Section

* Modern split-layout hero
* Responsive image slider
* Conference branding
* Call-to-action buttons
* Dynamic responsive typography

## Conference Overview

* Academic conference introduction
* Research areas showcase
* Conference theme section
* Editorial typography layout

## Conference Details

* Official conference schedule
* Date, time, venue, and agenda information
* Responsive information panel

## Publication Opportunities

* Risenologi Journal
* Journal of Castle (JoC)
* Proceedings of Castle (PoC)
* Publication pathway showcase

## Keynote Speakers

* International speaker profiles
* Responsive speaker cards
* Academic institution showcase

## Conference Timeline

* Important conference milestones
* Submission schedule
* Editorial-style timeline cards

## Publication Fee

* Responsive publication fee table
* Clean academic pricing structure
* Mobile-friendly layout

## Bilingual Support

* English ↔ Indonesian language toggle
* Dynamic content switching
* Responsive multilingual experience

## Responsive Design

Optimized for:

* Desktop
* Laptop
* Tablet
* Mobile devices

---

# Technology Stack

The website is built using:

* HTML5
* CSS3
* Vanilla JavaScript

No external frontend frameworks are used.

---

# Design Direction

The website follows a:

* clean academic conference aesthetic
* modern editorial UI approach
* publication-oriented hierarchy
* minimalist international symposium style

Color palette:

* Navy Blue
* Soft Blue
* White
* Light Gray

Typography:

* Inter
* Orbitron

